  "steps": [
    "Boil the potatoes until very soft. Drain, mash with a fork and mix in the egg.",
    "Add the shredded chicken, salt, turmeric, paprika and nutmeg and mix into a smooth dough that's easy to shape.",
    "Take portions of about 50 g, flatten in your palm, put a cube of mozzarella in the centre, close and roll into a ball.",
    "Crush the toasts into coarse crumbs and roll the balls in them, pressing lightly so the coating sticks.",
    "Air-fry at 180 °C for about 15 minutes, until golden and crisp."
